hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1175","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Logon mein behtar mera zamana hai. Phir jo unkey peechey hain. Phir jo unkey peechey hain. Phir qaumein aaengi jinki gawahi unki qasam se pehley hogi aur unki qasam unki gawahi se pehley hogi. (Bukhari: 2652)"
"1176","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey sab se badey gunaahon ki khabar na dun? Teen martaba. Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna aur waalidain ki naafarmaani. Aur Aap baithey jabke tek lagaaey huey they. To farmaya: Khabardaar! Aur jhoothi baat! Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap use dohraatey rahey yahan tak ke ham ne kaha: Kaash Aap khaamosh ho jaatey. (Bukhari: 2654)"
"1177","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko masjid mein padhtey huey suna. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah us par rehem farmaaey! Beshak us ne mujhey fulaan fulaan aayatein yaad dilaain jo main fulaan fulaan surat mein se gira chuka tha. (Bukhari: 2655)"
"1178","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey ghar mein tahajjud padhi aur masjid mein Abbaad ki namaz padhney ki aawaaz suni. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya ye Abbaad ki aawaaz hai? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Abbaad par rehem farma. (Bukhari: 2655). Ifk ki hadees."
"1179","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar par nikalna chaaahtey to apni biwiyon key darmiyaan qura andaazi kartey. To jinki qura nikalti unhey apne sath ley jaatey. To Aap ne hamaarey darmiyaan us ghazwe mein qura andaazi ki jo Aap ne kya. To mera qura nikla. To main Aap key sath Hijaab naazil honay key baad nikli. To main haudaj mein uthaai jaati aur us mein utaari jaati. To ham chaley yahan tak ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne us ghazwe se faarigh huey aur wapas aey aur ham Madina key qareeb huey to raat ko kooch ka elaan kya gaya. To main uthi jab kooch ka elaan kya gaya tha. To chali yahan tak ke lashkar se aagey nikal gai. Phir jab main ne apni haajat poori ki to apne thikaaney ki taraf aai aur apna seena chhua to mera Zafaar key naakhunon ka haar toot chuka tha. To main wapas aai aur apna haar talaash kya. To uski talaash ne mujhey rok liya. To wo aey jo merey liye oont tayyaar kartey they. To unhon-ne mera haudaj uthaaya aur use merey oont par rakkha jis par main sawaar hoti thi jabke wo samajhtey they ke main us mein hun. Aur auratein us waqt halki thein, bhaari na huin thein aur un par gosht na chadha tha. Wo sirf thoda khaana khaati thein. To qaum ne jab use uthaaya to haudaj ka bojh mehsoos na kya aur use utha liya. Aur main kam umr ladki thi. To unhon-ne oont ko uthaa diya aur chal diye. To mujhey mera haar mila jab lashkar jaa chuka tha. To main unkey thikaaney par aai jabke us mein koi na tha. To main apne us thikaaney par aai jahaan main thi. To mera khayaal tha ke wo mujhey gum paaengey aur merey paas wapas aaeengey. Phir jabke main baithi thi ke meri aankhein mujh par ghaalib aa gaein aur main so gai. Aur Safwaan bin Muattal Sulami phir Zakwaani lashkar key peechey tha. To wo subah merey thikaaney par pahuncha aur soey huey insaan ka saaya dekha. To wo merey paas aaya jabke wo mujhey Hijaab se pehley dekhta tha. To main uskey Istirjaa se jaagi jab us ne apni oontni bithaai aur uska haath dabaa diya. To main us par sawaar hui. To wo meri oontni haank kar ley chala yahan tak ke ham lashkar key paas aey jab wo dopahar key aaraam mein utrey huey they. To jo halaak hua halaak hua. Aur jis ne Ifk uthaaaya tha wo Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salool tha. To ham Madina aey aur main us mein mahina bhar beemaar rahi jabke log Ifk walon ki baat phaila rahey they. Aur mujhey merey marz mein shak mein daalta tha ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wo narmi nahi dekhti thi jo main Aap se dekhti thi jab main beemaar hoti. Aap sirf daakhil hotey aur salaam kehtey, phir farmatey: Wo kaisi hain? Mujhey us mein se kuchh maloom na hota yahan tak ke main theek hui. To main aur Umm Mistah qadha-e-haajat ki jagah ki taraf niklein. Ham raat key siwa raat ko na nikalteen. Aur wo us se pehley tha ke ham apne gharon key qareeb pakhaanay banaaein. Aur hamaara muamla pehley Arbon key muamley jaisa jangal ya seyr mein tha. To main aur Umm Mistah bint Abi Ruhm chalney lagein. To wo apni chaadar mein thokar khai aur us ne kaha: Mistah halaak ho! To main ne us se kaha: Tum ne bura kaha. Kya tum aisey aadmi ko bura kehtin ho jo Badr mein haazir hua tha? To us ne kaha: Ae haan! Kya tum ne nahi suna jo unhon-ne kaha? To us ne mujhey Ifk walon ki baat bataai. To mera marz badh gaya. Phir jab main apne ghar wapas aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas daakhil huey aur salaam kya aur farmaya: Wo kaisi hain? To main ne kaha: Mujhey apne maan baap ki taraf ijazat dijiye. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main us waqt un donon se khabar ki tasdeeq chaahteen thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ijazat dey di. To main apne maan baap key paas aai aur apni waalida se kaha: Log kya baat kartey hain? To unhon-ne kaha: Ae meri beti! Apne aap par muamla halka karo. Allah ki qasam! Kam hi aisi aurat hui hai jo khubsurat ho apne aadmi key paas jo us se mohabbat rakhta ho aur uski sautanein hon magar wo us par (baatein) badhaatin. To main ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Aur beshak log iskey baarey mein baat kartey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To main us raat rahi yahan tak ke subah hui jabke mera aansu na thamta tha aur na main neend se surma lagaaeen. Phir subah hui. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali bin Abi Taalib aur Usaama bin Zaid ko bulaaya jab wahi mein der hui, un donon se apne ghar walon se judai key baarey mein mashwara kartey huey. Lekin Usaama ne Aap ko uska ishaara kya jo wo apne dil mein unki mohabbat jaanta tha. To Usaama ne kaha: Tumhaarey ghar waley Ya Rasulullah! Aur ham Allah ki qasam bhalai key siwa nahi jaantey. Aur Ali bin Abi Taalib ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ne tum par tangi nahi ki hai. Aur auratein uskey siwa bahut hain. Aur londi se poochho, wo tumhey sach bataaeygi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Barira ko bulaaya. To farmaya: Ae Barira! Kya tum ne us mein koi baat dekhi hai jo tumhey shak mein daaley? To Barira ne kaha: Nahi, qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Main ne us mein koi baat nahi dekhi jis par main usey aib lagaaun, magar itni ke wo kam umr ladki hai jo aatey par so jaati hai aur paaltu bakri aati hai aur use khaa jaati hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us din khadey huey aur Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salool se (apne bachao ka) uzr maanga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun mujhey aisey aadmi se bachaaeyga jiski takleef mujhey merey ghar walon mein pahunchi hai. Allah ki qasam! Main ne apne ghar walon par bhalai key siwa nahi jaana. Aur unhon-ne aadmi ka zikr kya hai jis par main ne bhalai key siwa nahi jaana. Aur wo merey ghar walon key paas merey sath key siwa daakhil na hota tha. To Saad bin Muaz khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main Allah ki qasam tumhey us se bachaaunga. Agar wo Aus mein se hua to ham uski gardan maarengey. Aur agar wo hamaarey Khazraj bhaiyon mein se hua to tum hamein hukm do aur ham us mein tumhaara hukm karengey. To Saad bin Ubada khadey huey jabke wo Khazraj key sardaar they. Aur wo us se pehley nek aadmi they, lekin unhey ghairat ne uksaaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam! Tum use qatl na karogey aur na us par taaqat rakhtey ho. To Usaid bin Huzair khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam! Allah ki qasam ham use zaroor qatl karengey. Beshak tum munaafiq ho jo munaafiqon ki taraf se jhagadtey ho. To donon qabeelay Aus aur Khazraj uthay yahan tak ke ladney lagey jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par they. To Aap utrey aur unhey naram kya yahan tak ke wo khaamosh ho gaey aur Aap khaamosh ho gaey. Aur main apna din roi jabke mera aansu na thamta tha aur na main neend se surma lagaaeen. To merey maan baap merey paas subah aey jabke main do raatein aur din ro chuki thi yahan tak ke mera khayaal tha ke rona mera kaleija phaad dega. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jabke wo donon merey paas baithey they aur main ro rahi thi ke Ansaar ki aik aurat ne ijazat maangi. To main ne use ijazat di aur wo merey sath roney baithi. Phir jabke ham aise they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) daakhil huey aur baithey. Aur merey paas us din se na baithey they jab merey baarey mein jo kaha gaya tha kaha gaya tha us se pehley. Aur Aap mahina bhar thehrey they ke Aap par merey muamley mein kuchh wahi na hui thi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne tashahhud padha phir farmaya: Ae Aisha! Beshak mujhey tumhaarey baarey mein aisa aisa pahuncha hai. Phir agar tum paak ho to Allah tumhey paak karaar dega. Aur agar tum gunaah ko pahunchi ho to Allah se maghfirat maango aur uski taraf tauba karo. Beshak banda jab apne gunaah ka iqraar karta hai phir tauba karta hai to Allah uski tauba qabool karta hai. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni baat poori ki to mera aansu sukh gaya yahan tak ke main us mein se qatra mehsoos na karti thi. Aur main ne apne waalid se kaha: Meri taraf se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawaab do. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya kahun. To main ne apni waalida se kaha: Meri taraf se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawaab do jo Aap ne farmaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanti ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya kahun. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main kam umr ladki thi, Quran bahut na padhti thi. To main ne kaha: Beshak main Allah ki qasam jaan chuki hun ke tum ne suna hai jo log baat kartey hain aur wo tumharey dilon mein baith gaya hai aur tum ne usey sach samjha hai. Aur agar main tum se kahun ke main paak hun, jabke Allah jaanta hai ke main paak hun, to tum mujhey uskey sath sachcha na samjhoge. Aur agar main tumhaarey saamney muamley ka iqraar karun jabke Allah jaanta hai ke main paak hun to tum mujhey sachcha samjhoge. Aur Allah ki qasam! Main apne liye aur tumharey liye Yusuf key waalid key siwa misaal nahi paati jab unhon-ne kaha: (To achha sabr hai aur Allah se madad maangi jaati hai us par jo tum bayan kartey ho). Phir main apne bistar par palti jabke main ummeed rakhti thi ke Allah mujhey paak karaar dega. Lekin Allah ki qasam! Main ne gumaan na kya tha ke merey muamley mein wahi naazil hogi. Aur main apne aap mein us se zyada haqeer thi ke merey muamley mein Quran bola jaey. Lekin main ummeed rakhti thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) neend mein khwaab dekhengey jis se Allah mujhey paak karaar dega. To Allah ki qasam! Aap ne apni majlis na chhodi aur ghar walon mein se koi na nikla yahan tak ke Aap par wahi naazil hui. To Aap ko wo lagi jo sakhti lagti thi yahan tak ke Aap se sard din mein motiyon jaisa paseena behta tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (wo kefiyat) door hui jabke Aap hans rahey they. To pehli baat jo Aap ne ki wo ye thi ke Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Aisha! Allah ki hamd karo, beshak Allah ne tumhey paak karaar diya hai. To meri waalida ne mujh se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf utho. To main ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Main unki taraf na uthungi aur na Allah key siwa hamd karungi. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Beshak jo Ifk ley kar aey tum mein se giroh hain) aayatein. Phir jab Allah ne meri paaki mein ye naazil farmaya to Abu Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, jabke wo Mistah bin Usaasa par uski rishtedaari ki wajah se kharch kartey they: Allah ki qasam! Main Mistah par kabhi kuchh kharch na karunga, uskey baad jo us ne Aisha key liye kaha. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Aur tum mein fazl aur kushaadgi waley qasam na khaaen ke dengey) uskey qaul (Maaf karney wala Rehem karney wala) tak. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kyun nahi, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main pasand karta hun ke Allah mujhey maaf farmaaey. To wo Mistah ki taraf wapas aey jis par wo jaari rakhtey they. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zainab bint Jahsh se merey muamley key baarey mein poochhtey they. To farmaya: Ae Zainab! Tum ne kya jaana, kya dekha? To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main apne kaan aur apni aankh bachaati hun. Allah ki qasam! Main ne us par bhalai key siwa nahi jaana. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wahi thein jo mujh se baraabari karti thein. To Allah ne unhey parhezgaari key sath bachaaya. (Bukhari: 2661)"
"1180","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aadmi ki tareef ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Tum ne apne saathi ki gardan kaat di. Tum ne apne saathi ki gardan kaat di. Kayi martaba. Phir farmaya: Jo tum mein apne bhai ki tareef karney wala ho, laachaar to use kehna chaahiye: Main fulaan ko aisa gumaan karta hun aur Allah uska hisaab lenay wala hai. Aur main Allah par kisi ko paakiza nahi kehta. Main use aisa aisa gumaan karta hun, agar wo us mein se wo jaanta ho. (Bukhari: 2662)"
"1181","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use Uhad key din pesh kya jabke wo chaudah saal ka tha. To Aap ne mujhey ijazat na di. Phir mujhey Khandaq key din pesh kya jabke main pandrah saal ka tha. To Aap ne mujhey ijazat dey di. (Bukhari: 2664)"
"1182","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaum par qasam pesh ki aur wo jaldi karney lagey. To Aap ne hukm diya ke unkey darmiyaan qasam mein qura andaazi ki jaey ke un mein se kaun qasam khaey. (Bukhari: 2674)"
"1183","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaaney wala ho to use Allah ki qasam khaani chaahiye ya khaamosh rehna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 2679). Sulah ki kitaab."
